    "body": "Moved shared pagination to a persistent bottom-center bar. Its order is <<, <, editable X/Y, >, >>. The inner buttons move one page; the edge buttons jump to first or last. Clicking X selects it for direct numeric entry, with out-of-range values clamped to the available pages. Rendered checks passed all actions and edge states on the 11-page RDR2 Data Map and 4-page Warband Items view, including fixed placement while scrolling and unchanged live settings.",
